{"path":"outputs/pr_review_comments/comment4.md","content":"💡 **SUGGESTION: Two consecutive `setState` calls can be one**

```dart
setState(() => _errorMessage = null);
setState(() => _busy = true);
```

Both mutate state before the same frame is scheduled; merge them:

```dart
